    "English" : {
      "shouldTranslate" : false
    },
    "Hydrate 用于学习 Swift 以及 SwiftUI 开发以及供个人、非商业性地使用，内容版权属于 [asmr.one](https://asmr.one) 或音声原发布平台以及音声作者本人。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Hydrate should be used for studying Swift & SwiftUI app development and should be used individually and non-commercially. Copyright of contents belongs to [asmr.one](https://asmr.one) or content source publisher and voice actor itself."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "下载" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Download"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "下载作品中的全部音频时，仅下载最符合偏好的一组音频。靠前的文件类型优先级更高。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "When downloading all audio of a work, only the set of audio that best matches your preferences will be downloaded. File types listed earlier in this list will have higher priority."
